{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "adbd22cb-e77a-8c78-b81e-896db5f0f1dd",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T11:02:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Fernando R. Correia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:01:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, happy new year! How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:01:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, good morning. I am calling about the skating area. Is it open today? I am on speakerphone, I hope you can hear me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:01:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Which skating area do you mean, the outdoor rink?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:01:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the outdoor one, at the park by the beach. For the ice. Is it open now, this week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:01:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the weather, honestly. It's been cold, but the ice needs to be solid, so I'd check the posted status before you drive over. I don't have today's call in front of me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:01:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is there a web page with the same information? Because I just opened a credit union account, so now I am setting up everything online, you know, bookmarks and so on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:02:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Congratulations! Yes, the city website has a recreation page, and the skating status gets updated there. Just search Newport recreation and look for the skating link."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:02:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Search Newport recreation, skating link. Good. And if it says, um, \"subject to conditions,\" what does that mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:02:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It means it might be open, or it might close if the ice or the weather changes. So check again that day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:02:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. That is all I need. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:02:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Fernando. Have a good one!"
    }
  ],
